s":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105584","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105584.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105584.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Deprecates GridMap built-in navmesh feature, aka `bake_navigation` option.\r\n\r\nAlso removes the half broken edge connection margin debug. It is not essential for compatibility and causes development issues. This debug will be rendered by the server (soon) going forward.\r\n\r\nTo be clear, this PR is NOT removing general navmesh support for GridMap. Also not removing NavigationMesh from MeshLibrary as some projects may use that resource navmesh for custom stuff.\r\n\r\nYou can bake navmesh using GridMap with e.g. `NavigationRegion3D` or `NavigationServer3D` just fine like usual.  In fact both can be improved the moment we no longer need to care to support the inferior and technically broken and unfixable built-in version of GridMap.\r\n\r\nThe problems with the GridMap built-in navmesh are a long list. To be blunt that feature was a design failure from the moment it was added (2016) as it ignored core basics of navmesh making half the issues unfixable.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105584/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105584/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}